w surrounds, a cornice; the museum's 2009 glass entrance on Fifth under a thin canopy; the theatre block at the back; Central Park's Conservatory Garden across the avenue. Guessed: the height (about six storeys), the window rhythm, the block's depth, and the taller neighbour behind (the ground file shows a twelve-storey building beside it, modelled plainly)."}